@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch19ch20-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch19ch20-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 19 and 20"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.5.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch19ch20-lineage/1.5.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch19ch20_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.5.0 (2026-11-12): Story-uniqueness check of chapters 19-20 recorded; the drafts are unblocked."@en .

ex:TK8_Unique_Compare backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Ran 08-tooling/sen0414_story_repeat_check_v1_0_0.py 19 20 on 2026-11-12 (log 08-tooling/ch19-deck/story_repeat_check_ch19_20_run1.log): the 12 stories of chapters 19 and 20 against the newest stories of chapters 1 to 18 and each other. No shared link; best word overlap 0.108 (threshold 0.25); one shared name, Bell Labs, for UnixEpoch1971 with ch5 PrintDebugging (Brian Kernighan, 1979) and ch8 Utf8Diner (Ken Thompson and Rob Pike, 1992): different people, events, years and links, so not a repeat. Result CLEAN. A lower bound: the check cannot see a story told in other words from another source." .
ex:TK8_Unique_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ; backlog:hasAuditNote "Re-ran by a second method (a keyword scan of who, title and story for Unix, Bell Labs, Gmail, SMS, cron, spam, AT&T and others) and read each hit: Gmail in ch18 AjaxName2005 and cron in ch12 BickingPip2008 and ch16 AcidNamed1983 are mentions inside other stories, not the same story; the ch20 Gmail story is about the 2004 launch. Same agent as the builder, so not independent in the sense of the Definition of Done (2); the owner is asked to read the chapter drafts, where each story's source is listed, and may overrule." .
ex:ST8_StoryUniqueness backlog:hasState backlog:Done .
ex:ST8_DraftCh19 backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:ST8_DraftCh20 backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:TK8_Draft_Ch19 backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .
ex:TK8_Draft_Ch20 backlog:hasState backlog:Ready .

ex:Obs1_Obj8_StoriesChecked a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj8_StoriesChecked ;
    backlog:observedValue 0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-12T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rdfs:comment "Measured: 12 stories checked, 0 repeats found, 0 left unchecked."@en .
